    "stdout": "'mathlib2_mason_lemma1' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'mathlib2_dvd_linear_combination' does not depend on any axioms\n'mathlib2_quotient_dvd_self' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'mathlib2_mason_lemma2' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\ntheorem mathlib2_mason_lemma2.{u_1} : ∀ {k : Type u_1} [inst : Field k] [inst_1 : DecidableEq k] (a b : k[X]),\n  a ≠ 0 → a / radical a ∣ a.wronskian b :=\nfun {k} [Field k] [DecidableEq k] a b ha =>\n  id (mathlib2_dvd_linear_combination (mathlib2_quotient_dvd_self a) (mathlib2_mason_lemma1 a ha) (derivative b) b)\n",
